---
# CERT C/C++ Security-Focused Rules
# Emphasizes memory safety and critical vulnerabilities

- description: CERT C++ Security Essentials
- qlpack: codeql/cpp-queries
- queries: .
  from: codeql/cpp-queries
- include:
    tags contain:
      - external/cert
    tags contain any:
      - security
      - correctness
- include:
    tags contain any:
      - external/cert/arr
      - external/cert/mem
      - external/cert/str
